# Agon 08_sand_casualpirates layers 6+7: the SelectTarget force run (metroid_force2.py). Damage
# first (GetGrowthStage), then the metroid keeps a target on the pirate and is put in SelectTarget
# again and again so mState passes through Two several times with the forced (invalid) target.
@f300 layer 6
@f340 layer 7
@f560 god 1; give morphBall 1; give missile 20
@f580 send u0547 Activate; send u053d Activate; send u0539 Activate
@f600 hurt u0547 1; hurt u053d 1
@f620 damage u0547 40 0 powerbomb
@f700 place u04d8 355.43 -240.26 3.79; place u0547 355.43 -240.26 3.79; fsm u0547 SelectTarget
@f900 obj u0547
@f1000 fsm u0547 SelectTarget
@f1100 place u0547 player 2; fsm u0547 SelectTarget
@f1200 fsm u0547 SelectTarget
@f1300 place u0547 player 2; fsm u0547 SelectTarget
@f1400 fsm u0547 SelectTarget
@f1500 place u0547 player 2; fsm u0547 SelectTarget
@f1600 fsm u0547 SelectTarget
@f1700 obj u0547; status
